WEBVTT

00:01.440 --> 00:09.990
<b>Bauer Kingdom {middle}</b>

00:01.440 --> 00:09.990
<b>Nur Empire {top}</b>

00:01.440 --> 00:09.990
<b>Nur Empire {right}</b>

00:01.440 --> 00:09.990
<b>Sousse Kingdom {bottom}</b>

00:01.830 --> 00:03.430
<i>The Bauer Kingdom,</i>

00:03.840 --> 00:09.680
<i>to this day, is still under threat 
from the Nur Empire to the east.</i>

00:09.990 --> 00:14.990
<i>The most powerful families 
eventually became royalty or nobility,</i>

00:14.990 --> 00:17.240
<i>and began to collect taxes from commoners</i>

00:17.240 --> 00:19.630
<i>as they worked to maintain 
peace in their domains.</i>

00:20.300 --> 00:23.150
<i>But with the rise of magic,</i>

00:23.150 --> 00:26.010
<i>the equilibrium is slowly falling apart.</i>

00:26.410 --> 00:29.380
<i>King l'Aussiel, a proponent of meritocracy,</i>

00:29.380 --> 00:31.940
<i>began to accept commoners 
as scholarship students.</i>

00:32.350 --> 00:35.480
<i>The Royal Academy was celebrated 
for treating all students equally...</i>

00:35.480 --> 00:37.080
<i>or so it was believed.</i>

02:07.980 --> 02:12.990
<b>Episode 8</b>

02:07.980 --> 02:12.990
<b>The Swirling Currents Are All Machinations</b>

02:19.550 --> 02:21.660
<i>Prince Yu's attendant, Master Dede,</i>

02:21.660 --> 02:24.470
<i>attacked a student in the Commoner Movement.</i>

02:25.600 --> 02:28.090
To attack him with magic...

02:28.090 --> 02:30.750
No matter what might have 
happened, that's extreme.

02:31.560 --> 02:34.880
Most likely, that commoner 
said something offensive.

02:36.760 --> 02:40.640
It was called the "Commoner 
Movement," wasn't it?

02:41.440 --> 02:44.640
They were spewing nonsense about 
nobles and commoners being equal.

02:45.090 --> 02:47.950
It seemed they didn't understand 
their position at all.

02:49.310 --> 02:52.050
"Out of the mouth comes evil," as they say.

02:52.610 --> 02:53.990
So...

02:54.900 --> 02:57.640
Would it be acceptable 
if it was the other way around?

02:58.480 --> 03:00.410
W-Well...

03:03.210 --> 03:04.670
Just kidding!

03:04.670 --> 03:08.560
If anything, I <i>want</i> Miss Claire 
to hurl insults at me!

03:11.720 --> 03:14.160
<i>Well, the situation is what it is.</i>

03:14.160 --> 03:16.560
<i>Guess I can't blame her 
for not playing along.</i>

03:18.370 --> 03:21.850
U-Um... His treatment is complete.

03:31.010 --> 03:32.980
You're Matt, right?

03:35.010 --> 03:36.240
Taylor?

03:36.790 --> 03:41.160
I'm here to speak with you 
on behalf of the Academy Knights.

03:41.160 --> 03:44.370
I know you're in pain, 
but could you answer my questions?

03:46.750 --> 03:47.870
No.

03:49.250 --> 03:52.960
Everyone knows the Knights 
are on the nobles' side.

03:52.960 --> 03:58.010
I have nothing to say to a commoner 
who's been tainted by the aristocracy.

03:58.630 --> 04:02.720
Matt, the Knights are allies of all students.

04:03.070 --> 04:05.720
And... I think it would be best 
if you talked to us.

04:06.320 --> 04:08.870
You're a commoner like us,

04:08.870 --> 04:11.860
so quarreling with nobles puts you 
in an undesirable position.

04:11.860 --> 04:15.390
You see?! There is no justice 
in this kingdom!

04:15.390 --> 04:16.960
That's why we—

04:18.790 --> 04:20.450
Relax, Matt.

04:20.450 --> 04:24.360
We're here to keep anything 
that unfair from happening.

04:24.360 --> 04:27.080
Please, tell me what happened.

04:28.470 --> 04:32.840
At first... it was just an argument.

04:33.460 --> 04:37.260
Prince Yu was listening to our message,

04:38.070 --> 04:39.880
but <i>he</i> caught wind of it.

04:39.880 --> 04:43.760
Listen here! Never come near Prince Yu again!

04:44.330 --> 04:47.980
And then... I couldn't stop myself.

04:48.570 --> 04:50.650
I said royals and nobles are nothing

04:50.650 --> 04:54.110
but parasites that leech 
tax money from commoners!

04:54.110 --> 04:55.480
What?!

04:55.970 --> 04:58.160
Please stay calm, Miss Claire.

04:58.160 --> 05:00.450
Hearing what he has to say comes first.

05:03.470 --> 05:05.200
Myself aside,

05:05.200 --> 05:08.880
I couldn't stand for him 
speaking ill of Prince Yu.

05:09.270 --> 05:11.620
So without thinking, I took out my wand...

05:11.950 --> 05:14.510
You'd best shut your mouth!

05:14.510 --> 05:17.460
I won't stand for such insults!

05:25.830 --> 05:28.280
The next thing I knew, I was on this bed.

05:29.990 --> 05:31.420
Damn it...

05:32.230 --> 05:35.160
Who do those nobles think they are?!

05:35.730 --> 05:40.470
Are we commoners not even allowed to speak?!

05:43.540 --> 05:46.140
I was only trying to intimidate him, truly.

05:46.140 --> 05:50.120
I had no intention of using magic, 
much less attacking him.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.850
I swear to God!

05:52.730 --> 05:54.480
Where is Dede's wand?

05:54.480 --> 05:57.750
It was confiscated on the spot 
and sent for analysis.

05:58.370 --> 06:00.200
I will be inspecting it soon.

06:01.310 --> 06:05.800
For the innocent commoner who 
has fallen victim to a corrupt noble,

06:06.130 --> 06:08.430
we stand firm in our protest!

06:08.770 --> 06:11.600
The noble who attacked him 
must be severely punished!

06:11.600 --> 06:14.280
Yeah!

06:15.230 --> 06:19.320
Word of this incident spread 
outside the school at some point.

06:19.320 --> 06:24.120
Yu, why were you meeting with this Matt guy?

06:24.120 --> 06:26.700
He said he wanted me to hear his message.

06:27.250 --> 06:31.200
He asked me to help him, 
but I refused, of course!

06:31.620 --> 06:35.080
Still, that was pretty careless.

06:35.080 --> 06:37.460
You need to consider your own position.

06:39.970 --> 06:42.840
"Before God, all are equal."

06:42.840 --> 06:45.350
One of the Spiritual Church's teachings?

06:46.110 --> 06:48.970
The Church's doors are open to all.

06:49.710 --> 06:52.720
That's why it felt wrong to shut him out 
without even seeing him.

06:53.660 --> 06:57.730
<i>Let's talk a bit about the lineage 
of the Bauer family.</i>

06:58.140 --> 07:00.650
<i>The mother of Prince Rod and Prince Thane</i>

07:00.650 --> 07:03.120
<i>was a princess from the 
neighboring land of the Alpes.</i>

07:03.120 --> 07:06.240
<i>She was the former queen, 
who died at a young age.</i>

07:06.810 --> 07:11.080
<i>And Prince Yu's mother is 
the current queen, Riche.</i>

07:11.080 --> 07:14.850
<i>Before marrying the king, she was 
a cardinal of the Spiritual Church.</i>

07:15.250 --> 07:19.250
<i>The Church is the dominant religion here, 
devoted to the spirits.</i>

07:19.250 --> 07:23.150
<i>The kingdom hoped that the marriage would
give it power over the church.</i>

07:23.150 --> 07:26.530
<i>But in the end, the Church 
grew even more powerful</i>

07:26.530 --> 07:28.260
<i>due to its closeness to the royal family.</i>

07:28.910 --> 07:33.140
<i>Prince Yu could be called 
a symbol of the Church's authority.</i>

07:34.670 --> 07:38.340
The Church's teachings are in line 
with the Commoner Movement's beliefs.

07:38.680 --> 07:42.150
There are even rumors 
that the Church finances them.

07:43.220 --> 07:47.450
They probably approached Prince Yu 
in hope of requesting his aid.

07:49.120 --> 07:51.770
I'll admit that it was careless of me.

07:51.770 --> 07:54.370
But Dede would never do something like that!

07:54.370 --> 07:55.660
I believe in him!

07:57.160 --> 08:02.040
Dede is saying that he lost control 
and his magic discharged on its own.

08:02.040 --> 08:04.170
Were any defects found in his wand?

08:06.030 --> 08:08.840
I inspected it with that in mind myself,

08:08.840 --> 08:11.330
but I found no signs of malfunction.

08:11.330 --> 08:15.060
If an expert in magic tools like 
you says so, it must be true.

08:16.180 --> 08:20.490
Frankly, anything that happens outside 
the Academy is out of our hands.

08:20.490 --> 08:24.620
We should just do everything we can 
until Dede's punishment is decided.

08:24.620 --> 08:28.420
Thane, Yu, and I will try to make 
the noble students understand.

08:28.820 --> 08:31.060
Rae and Misha, you'll talk 
to the commoner students.

08:31.060 --> 08:33.480
Give them a chance 
to vent their frustrations.

08:34.080 --> 08:36.510
Why do you look so discontent with that?

08:36.510 --> 08:40.670
Well, I'm really bad 
at difficult stuff like that!

08:41.190 --> 08:44.210
Maybe if you'd pet my head, Miss Claire...

08:44.210 --> 08:44.920
Huh?!

08:44.920 --> 08:47.340
Then I could try my best.

08:47.860 --> 08:49.340
<i>Claire...</i>

08:53.760 --> 08:56.120
Go on. Do your best.

08:56.120 --> 08:58.510
Not enough love. Try again.

08:59.190 --> 09:01.520
For crying out loud!

09:00.040 --> 09:01.520
Yes!

09:01.520 --> 09:03.390
Okay, take care of it.

09:03.390 --> 09:06.400
Let's quiet things down by the day 
Dede's punishment is decided.

09:06.400 --> 09:08.400
Yeah!

09:20.910 --> 09:23.170
<b>One Week Later</b>

09:24.920 --> 09:27.800
Ugh! It's too crowded!

09:27.800 --> 09:30.580
Well, the punishment for that 
incident is about to be announced.

09:30.580 --> 09:32.530
Of course everyone's curious.

09:33.180 --> 09:34.290
There he is!

09:42.230 --> 09:43.150
This...

09:43.780 --> 09:45.200
can't be...

09:45.970 --> 09:47.770
"Dede Murray...

09:48.250 --> 09:50.780
is placed under house arrest for one week."

09:51.270 --> 09:53.280
Hey! You gotta be kidding!

09:53.280 --> 09:55.450
House arrest?! For only a week?!

09:55.450 --> 09:57.780
He almost killed someone! 
You can't be serious!

09:59.120 --> 10:00.120
Miss Claire!

10:00.770 --> 10:03.080
It's dangerous for nobles 
to be here right now.

10:03.080 --> 10:05.360
But we have to calm this commotion!

10:05.360 --> 10:06.920
That's not possible right now.

10:06.920 --> 10:08.130
Quickly, this way.

10:10.210 --> 10:12.890
<i>What's going to happen now?</i>

10:15.500 --> 10:17.540
Where's your meritocracy now?!

10:17.540 --> 10:19.950
Weren't we all supposed to 
be equal at the Academy?!

10:19.950 --> 10:22.540
What you're doing now is 
the same crap you've always done!

10:22.540 --> 10:24.350
Only the nobles come out on top!

10:28.320 --> 10:30.730
Entry into the Academy is prohibited!

10:30.730 --> 10:31.780
Back off!

10:35.270 --> 10:36.780
The school will be closing for a while.

10:37.510 --> 10:40.660
The military will join our guards 
until the protests calm down.

10:41.250 --> 10:43.410
I can't stand by and accept this.

10:43.410 --> 10:46.950
That commoner was really badly hurt.

10:46.950 --> 10:50.550
Yet his attacker only has to spend 
a week under house arrest?

10:50.990 --> 10:53.760
Everyone here feels the same way.

10:54.120 --> 10:57.690
It seems some nobles who dislike 
the Commoner Movement

10:57.690 --> 10:59.810
sought a reduced sentence.

11:00.240 --> 11:03.040
I thought they'd seemed awfully quiet lately.

11:03.040 --> 11:05.440
We didn't handle this well at all.

11:05.440 --> 11:09.440
On top of everything, it looks like 
the Church is helping the nobles.

11:09.440 --> 11:11.300
What do you mean?

11:11.300 --> 11:14.320
Isn't the Church financing 
the Commoner Movement?

11:14.320 --> 11:16.370
That's all politics.

11:16.370 --> 11:20.450
They claim they never get involved in politics, 
but their real intentions are different.

11:20.450 --> 11:22.640
A power struggle, is it?

11:22.640 --> 11:25.460
The Church wants to take power from
the royal family.

11:25.820 --> 11:29.460
I bet they're making commoners 
and nobles clash by helping them both

11:29.460 --> 11:32.460
in an effort to weaken the authority 
of the nobility and royalty.

11:37.740 --> 11:40.850
Yu, Queen Riche has nothing 
to do with this, right?

11:40.850 --> 11:42.460
Who can say?

11:42.460 --> 11:44.980
I'm not privy to my mother's thoughts.

11:45.480 --> 11:47.980
Can't you meet with her?

11:48.400 --> 11:50.810
I requested an audience, but she refused.

11:50.810 --> 11:52.730
She's the queen, after all.

11:53.230 --> 11:55.960
Even though she's also your biological mother?

11:56.900 --> 11:58.960
What do you mean by that?

11:58.960 --> 12:00.530
Nothing deeper than that.

12:00.530 --> 12:03.450
Just being related by blood 
doesn't make things that easy!

12:04.450 --> 12:05.460
Excuse me!

12:07.350 --> 12:11.090
Perhaps what the Church 
is really trying to do

12:11.090 --> 12:13.840
is create a rift between the princes?

12:16.700 --> 12:18.030
True...

12:18.030 --> 12:21.040
I guess it won't help for 
the three of us to be at odds.

12:21.040 --> 12:23.050
Claire is exactly right.

12:23.500 --> 12:27.040
Fortunately, the military is 
protecting us from outside the gate.

12:27.040 --> 12:30.530
Let us continue to guard the school grounds.

12:50.880 --> 12:51.830
Miss Claire.

12:53.170 --> 12:54.460
What is it?

12:54.970 --> 12:57.100
Once you reach your room,

12:57.100 --> 12:59.540
please stay there until tomorrow.

13:00.220 --> 13:04.220
Huh? How can you say that 
when all this is going on?

13:04.570 --> 13:07.850
It's the Academy Knights' job to be 
on the move at a time like this, isn't it?

13:08.880 --> 13:10.790
You won't do as I ask?

13:10.790 --> 13:11.980
Of course not.

13:14.610 --> 13:15.900
I see.

13:16.240 --> 13:17.780
Then I have no choice.

13:21.780 --> 13:23.160
Miss Claire!

13:24.390 --> 13:26.080
What have you done, Rae?!

13:26.080 --> 13:29.580
It's all right. I just put her 
to sleep with magic.

13:30.390 --> 13:34.170
Lene, stay hidden in the dorm 
with Miss Claire.

13:34.590 --> 13:37.170
Don't leave the room, 
no matter what happens.

13:38.110 --> 13:41.280
The school gate is going to 
be broken down tonight.

13:41.280 --> 13:42.180
Huh?

13:42.180 --> 13:44.350
Wh-What do you mean?

13:44.350 --> 13:47.050
Rae, what is it that you know?

13:47.050 --> 13:50.430
Lene, do you love Miss Claire?

13:50.430 --> 13:52.330
Of course I love her!

13:52.330 --> 13:55.310
I've been serving her 
far longer than you have!

13:56.540 --> 13:59.530
I see. Then I'll trust you.

14:00.930 --> 14:02.780
I'm trusting you, Lene.

14:07.180 --> 14:08.290
Wait, Rae!

14:22.650 --> 14:23.970
We're not leaving!

14:28.720 --> 14:30.700
The soldiers just went down!

14:30.700 --> 14:33.120
I dunno what happened, 
but this is our chance!

14:40.040 --> 14:42.650
Captain! The gate has been breached!

14:43.120 --> 14:46.170
Work with the military to quiet the mob!

14:46.170 --> 14:48.340
Protect the Academy at any cost!

14:48.660 --> 14:50.480
Where are the dorms?!

14:50.480 --> 14:52.410
Capture that noble brat!

14:53.080 --> 14:54.160
Stop!

14:55.920 --> 14:58.500
This is an order from your future king.

14:58.500 --> 15:00.880
I'm not letting you get 
even one step closer.

15:15.840 --> 15:17.270
You're wasting your time.

15:17.620 --> 15:19.270
I broke it.

15:19.870 --> 15:21.930
The bell you use to control monsters.

15:25.280 --> 15:28.780
That was another invention 
of yours, wasn't it,

15:29.630 --> 15:31.040
Master Lambert?

15:40.880 --> 15:44.800
Rae Taylor? What are you doing here?

15:45.150 --> 15:47.130
I'm here to stop you.

15:47.130 --> 15:49.130
What are you talking about?

15:49.130 --> 15:52.510
I heard about the riot and came here 
to protect these priceless magic tools.

15:52.510 --> 15:55.640
You did something to Master 
Dede's wand, didn't you?

15:57.020 --> 16:00.730
That's a false accusation. 
There was nothing wrong with the wand.

16:00.730 --> 16:03.020
As confirmed by you yourself.

16:03.750 --> 16:06.030
Since you're a magic tool specialist

16:06.030 --> 16:09.740
and the one who's always inspecting 
and maintaining them,

16:09.740 --> 16:12.950
rigging Master Dede's wand 
to discharge on its own—

16:12.950 --> 16:14.790
and eliminating all evidence of it—

16:14.790 --> 16:16.650
must have been simple to do.

16:18.150 --> 16:19.860
And it wasn't just that incident.

16:20.190 --> 16:25.380
You've been fomenting animosity 
between nobles and commoners all along.

16:26.380 --> 16:28.790
And once the school 
was engulfed by a rioting mob,

16:28.790 --> 16:31.490
you were going to use that bell 
to make monsters attack.

16:31.490 --> 16:33.520
That was your plan, wasn't it?

16:35.330 --> 16:37.710
That's a very interesting deduction,

16:37.710 --> 16:39.480
but do you have any grounds for it?

16:40.120 --> 16:41.600
I don't.

16:42.860 --> 16:46.360
But I know everything.

16:47.110 --> 16:50.350
And I know the Commoner 
Movement means nothing to you.

16:51.670 --> 16:54.460
Assuming that what you say is right,

16:54.460 --> 16:58.000
what reason would I have to do any of that?

16:58.340 --> 16:59.930
<i>He's right.</i>

17:00.510 --> 17:03.650
<i>The Aurousseau Company 
is entrusted by the kingdom</i>

17:03.650 --> 17:05.810
<i>with the mining and 
distribution of magic stones,</i>

17:05.810 --> 17:08.380
<i>and they've amassed enormous wealth from it.</i>

17:08.380 --> 17:12.530
<i>If they were to take down the kingdom 
and nobles that gave them their riches,</i>

17:12.530 --> 17:14.300
<i>they'd be left with nothing.</i>

17:14.300 --> 17:17.410
<i>Normally, of course. But...</i>

17:18.040 --> 17:20.390
They're using Lene as a hostage, right?

17:22.150 --> 17:26.950
She's more than just your 
beloved little sister, isn't she?

17:26.950 --> 17:28.900
To you, Lene is...

17:30.150 --> 17:33.910
Rae Taylor, just how much do you know?

17:33.910 --> 17:37.460
Homosexual love isn't 
the only kind of forbidden love.

17:37.840 --> 17:40.930
You and Lene are blood siblings, as well as—

17:40.930 --> 17:41.920
Stop!

17:43.650 --> 17:48.340
Stop, Rae! Don't say any more than that!

17:48.860 --> 17:49.760
Lene!

17:50.510 --> 17:54.240
Please! Don't get in my brother's way!

17:54.720 --> 17:58.440
I don't want to hurt Miss Claire!

18:00.840 --> 18:03.360
It's a real shame, Lene.

18:04.420 --> 18:07.350
Master Lambert, please give it up.

18:07.750 --> 18:10.440
I promise I'll do something about Lene.

18:11.290 --> 18:12.270
You can't.

18:12.270 --> 18:13.220
Master Lambert!

18:13.220 --> 18:15.100
You don't know how terrifying he is.

18:15.100 --> 18:18.660
If I fail, he'll kill Lene.

18:18.660 --> 18:19.660
Rae!

18:24.210 --> 18:26.450
I just can't sleep in peace, can I?

18:27.750 --> 18:29.000
Miss Claire!

18:30.460 --> 18:31.500
Lene...

18:34.740 --> 18:37.010
I don't quite understand the full story here,

18:37.010 --> 18:41.300
but it is accurate to say that you two 
Aurousseaus are behind all this, yes?

18:42.170 --> 18:44.300
Surrender, both of you.

18:44.300 --> 18:47.560
No matter what you're planning, it ends here.

18:47.560 --> 18:49.190
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

18:51.080 --> 18:53.950
I'm afraid we can't have that.

18:55.200 --> 18:57.320
<i>Even my being here right now</i>

18:57.320 --> 19:00.080
<i>didn't happen in the game.</i>

19:00.390 --> 19:04.360
<i>I don't know what this 
development is, or who he is!</i>

19:04.360 --> 19:08.620
Lambert, hurry up and call a monster already.

19:08.620 --> 19:10.400
But this bell...

19:10.400 --> 19:12.120
Not a problem.

19:14.710 --> 19:16.010
All better now, right?

19:17.470 --> 19:19.990
As long as you do your job,

19:19.990 --> 19:22.470
I'll help you escape 
the country, as I promised.

19:23.030 --> 19:27.080
So you and your sister can live 
a new life, with new identities.

19:27.080 --> 19:30.270
Then the two of you can 
finally become lovers.

19:31.250 --> 19:32.300
Go on.

19:34.190 --> 19:35.450
Brother!

19:35.450 --> 19:36.820
Lambert!

19:37.270 --> 19:39.310
You want approval, don't you?

19:39.310 --> 19:42.090
You couldn't tell anyone 
about your love before.

19:45.350 --> 19:47.920
I'm sorry, Miss Claire.

19:48.490 --> 19:51.750
It's too late for us to turn back!

20:10.440 --> 20:12.690
A... chimera?

20:12.690 --> 20:13.930
Go on.

20:15.690 --> 20:18.700
Go! Eradicate the nobles!

20:25.900 --> 20:29.040
Miss Claire, let's withdraw for now! 
We'll ask the military to help!

20:30.340 --> 20:31.350
No.

20:31.350 --> 20:32.980
Miss Claire!

20:32.980 --> 20:35.070
If more people get hurt 
while we wait for the military,

20:35.070 --> 20:37.550
Lene and Lambert will be 
even more harshly punished.

20:38.490 --> 20:40.050
We'll hold it here!

20:40.050 --> 20:42.300
Lene belongs to me.

20:42.750 --> 20:44.720
It's my responsibility to supervise her!

20:49.240 --> 20:51.100
Honestly, Miss Claire...

20:51.590 --> 20:53.620
You're such a tsundere!

20:55.070 --> 20:57.840
Hang on! What does "tsundere" mean?!

20:57.840 --> 21:00.570
We're at a disadvantage here. 
Let's go somewhere else!

21:00.570 --> 21:02.320
You just casually ignored my question!

21:04.590 --> 21:05.370
Miss Claire!

21:18.590 --> 21:20.630
And that's a successful landing!

21:33.870 --> 21:35.080
Freeze!

21:43.550 --> 21:46.390
Your magic is absolutely absurd...

21:46.390 --> 21:49.750
When my Miss Claire is in trouble, 
a little spell like this is nothing!

21:49.750 --> 21:51.300
You—

21:54.420 --> 21:56.290
A chimera possesses multiple attributes.

21:56.290 --> 22:00.130
Its head is fire, its body is earth, 
and its tail is water.

22:01.030 --> 22:03.530
It'll probably break out of that ice soon.

22:05.020 --> 22:07.140
Which means, Miss Claire...

22:08.580 --> 22:12.240
We can call this the first labor of love 
of our new life together!

23:46.470 --> 23:49.370
Miss Claire, we're doing
our first labor of love together!

23:49.370 --> 23:50.660
Let's reenact the story of our love

23:50.660 --> 23:53.040
in a performance starring 
none other than ourselves!

23:53.040 --> 23:55.180
I see you're feeling relaxed 
enough to make jokes.

23:55.180 --> 23:58.270
Yes! As long as I have you, 
nothing can scare me!

23:58.270 --> 24:01.040
Good! Then let's do this!

23:59.540 --> 24:01.040
<b>Episode 9</b>

23:59.540 --> 24:01.040
<b>My Master Will Never Change.</b>
